        <rule id="cf90-1d71-d6f8-4501" name="Wizard" hidden="false">
          <description>Magic level 3; draw 3 spells before battle. Body armour and shields prevent spellcasting; steed barding does not. Book of Ashur/Crown of Sorcery effects and spell-deck changes require manual application. Warhammer Magic pp. 7–8; Bretonnia p. 61.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
    </selectionEntry>
